 4. 🦾 AI bull run turns four 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Financial Modeling Prep . Chart: Erica Pandey/Axios This bull market started Oct. 12, 2022 — so it turns 4 tomorrow.

 The S&amp;P 500 is trading near record highs ahead of the anniversary. The current bull run has gained 117%, the sixth-best-performing bull market since World War II, Reuters reports . 🐃 Zoom in: AI has dominated the latest bull run, with the launch of ChatGPT coming about a month after the bull market began.

 Oxford Economics estimates about one-third of recent U.S. economic growth stems from AI. Nvidia, whose AI chips made the company the most valuable in the world, has soared in market capitalization over those four years from $286 billion to $5.5 trillion. 

 
 
